<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
  <style>
    body {
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
    }
    .hero-card {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="py-5">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 800px;">
    <div class="hero-card p-4 p-md-5 text-center">
      <div class="badge bg-primary text-uppercase px-3 py-2 rounded-pill fw-bold mb-3">
        MEAN Stack &bull; MVC Architecture
      </div>
      <h1 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-2"><%= title %></h1>
      <p class="text-muted lead mb-4">
        Node.js + Express MVC Backend running on <strong>Port 5000</strong> with MongoDB on <strong>Port 3001</strong>.
      </p>

      <div class="row g-3 text-start mb-4">
        <div class="col-md-6">
          <div class="p-3 bg-light rounded-3 border">
            <h6 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-1"><i class="bi bi-diagram-3-fill text-primary me-2"></i>Architecture (MVC)</h6>
            <ul class="list-unstyled small mb-0 text-muted">
              <li><strong>M (Models):</strong> <code>/models/</code> (Item, Category, Order, User)</li>
              <li><strong>V (Views):</strong> <code>/views/</code> (EJS Templates) + Angular Client</li>
              <li><strong>C (Controllers):</strong> <code>/controllers/</code> (Business Logic)</li>
              <li><strong>R (Routes):</strong> <code>/routes/</code></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6">
          <div class="p-3 bg-light rounded-3 border">
            <h6 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-1"><i class="bi bi-database-fill-check text-success me-2"></i>Database Status</h6>
            <ul class="list-unstyled small mb-0 text-muted">
              <li><strong>Active Items:</strong> <span class="badge bg-success"><%= itemsCount %> items</span></li>
              <li><strong>Categories:</strong> <span class="badge bg-primary"><%= categoriesCount %> categories</span></li>
              <li><strong>Database URI:</strong> <code>mongodb://127.0.0.1:3001/shop_db</code></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center gap-3">
        <a href="<%= frontendUrl %>" class="btn btn-primary rounded-pill px-4 py-2 fw-bold" target="_blank">
          <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right me-1"></i> Open Angular Frontend (Port 4200)
        </a>
        <a href="/api" class="btn btn-outline-dark rounded-pill px-4 py-2 fw-semibold">
          <i class="bi bi-code-slash me-1"></i> Browse API Endpoints
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>

